    {"Controls how strongly sharpening is reduced across depth edges.\n\nHigher values more aggressively prevent sharpening across object boundaries (reduces halos).\nLower values allow more sharpening to pass across edges (sharper but riskier).", "控制跨深度边缘时锐化被削弱的强度。\n\n更高会更积极地避免跨物体边界锐化（减少光晕）。\n更低会让更多锐化穿过边缘（更锐，但风险更高）。"},
    {"Controls sharpness at high contrast areas.", "控制高对比区域的锐度。"},
    {"Controls the DXGI Present sync interval, which determines how\nthe swap chain waits for vertical refresh.\n\n0  = Present immediately, no VSync wait.\n1  = Sync to every refresh, normal VSync.\n2+ = Present every N refreshes, reducing effective frame rate.\n\nHigher values can reduce tearing but may increase latency and cap FPS.\nFor most games, use 0 for lowest latency or 1 for normal VSync.", "控制 DXGI Present 的同步间隔，也就是交换链如何等待垂直刷新。\n\n0  = 立即呈现，不等待垂直同步。\n1  = 每个刷新同步一次，普通垂直同步。\n2+ = 每 N 次刷新呈现一次，降低实际帧率。\n\n更高的值能减少撕裂，但可能增加延迟并限制 FPS。\n对大多数游戏，0 延迟最低，1 是普通垂直同步。"},
    {"Cope smarter, not harder", "更聪明地硬撑，而不是更用力"},
    {"Coping is strong with this one...", "这家伙的硬撑之力很强……"},
    {"Corresponds to amount of accumulation added per frame\nat pixel coordinate where disocclusion occured or when\nreactive mask value is > 0.0f. Decreasing this and \ndrawing the ghosting object (IE no mv) to reactive mask \nwith value close to 1.0f can decrease temporal ghosting.\nDecreasing this could result in more thin feature pixels flickering.", "对应每个像素每帧增加的累积量，\n用于发生遮挡解除的位置，或反应式遮罩\n大于 0.0f 时。降低此值，并把拖影物体\n（即没有运动矢量）以接近 1.0f 画进反应式遮罩，\n可以减少时间性拖影。\n降得太低会让细小特征像素闪烁更多。"},
